readAttributeBadRequestDuplicateIds.description:
The request included the same `id` multiple times as in the
following example.

<details><summary>Click to see the bad request</summary>

```json
{
  "method": "GET",
  "requests": [
    {
      "id": "1",
      "relativeUrl": "5437f1d4-4f83-5ace-be32-ebe0d962c658/attributes/presentValue"
    },
    {
      "id": "1",
      "relativeUrl": "cdf01d02-c426-5cc5-8944-61df1b1c0398/attributes/presentValue"
    }
  ]
}
```

</details>

